{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119595","id":3714110257,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7dYNMx","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119595","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119595.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119595.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119595","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119595/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119595/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119595/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/328c65b23397b86e4224670eacb7257dd7326302","number":119595,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix converting v3 mesh normals and tangents","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #63550\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThere were a number of issues in the functionality to convert the old ArrayMesh format to the new one:\r\n* The Tangent array data was accidentally written to the Normal array data as a result of an accidental use of the `ARRAY_NORMAL` offset\r\n  * As a result of this, the mesh was loaded with garbage normals and garbage tangents\r\n* Compressed normals and tangents weren't being properly decompressed before attempting to encode them\r\n   * when compressing normals and tangents without octahedral compression, they were multiplied by 127 and stored as an uint8_t ([see the old code](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ed879eb87b1d4cd8c100815f7061bf93511b6611/servers/visual_server.cpp#L534)); however, we were not dividing them by 127 when reading them.\r\n* The old value of `ARRAY_FLAG_USE_2D_VERTICES` was set on the new ArrayMesh `format` instead of the new one","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/